        <a href="#" class="hover:text-slate-300">개인정보처리방침</a>
        <span class="text-slate-700">|</span>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-slate-300">환자의 권리와 의무</a>
        <span class="text-slate-700">|</span>
        <a href="/non-covered" class="hover:text-slate-300">비급여 진료비 안내</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

